<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vencor rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vencor rated strong buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it resumed coverage of Vencor Inc as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Vencor gained 9/16 to 42-1/16.</p>
